"A LICENSE EARNED PAUSES DECAY FOR 10 DAYS (DOES NOT STACK).\n"
"FROM THE NEXT DAY PASSED."
msgstr ""
"CHAQUE JOUR PASSÉ RETIRE DES CRÉDITS: JOURS 2-9 (JOUR - 1) X 50,\n"
"DÈS LE JOUR 10 (JOUR - 9) X 500, AU PLUS 200 000 PAR JOUR.\n"
"UN PERMIS OBTENU SUSPEND LA PERTE 10 JOURS (NON CUMULABLE).\n"
"DÈS LE PROCHAIN JOUR PASSÉ."

#: src/platform/settings_menu.cpp
msgid ""
"YOUR CARS' POWER 0.25% LESS FOR EACH DAY PASSED, DOWN TO 5%,\n"
